<title>USA: Honda January US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Honda January US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Jan 1-31, 1997     Jan 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    44,730	    37,540	    +19.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,030	     2,015	     +0.7</p>
<p> Import Car		11,076	     7,508	    +47.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,470	     1,904	    -22.8</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26 in year-ago period.</p>
</text>
